<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Codex 0.153.3 dependency notices</title>
<style>body{max-width:80rem;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;font-family:sans-serif}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}section{border-top:1px solid;margin-top:2rem}</style></head><body>
<h1>Codex 0.153.3 dependency notices</h1>
<p>Generated using cargo-about 0.9.2 from the pinned upstream dependency graph.
This inventory covers all four distribution targets, including build dependencies;
not every listed component is linked into every binary. See README.md in this
directory for source availability, regeneration, and additional non-Cargo notices.</p>
{{#each licenses}}<section><h2>{{name}} ({{id}})</h2><ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} — {{crate.repository}}{{/if}}</li>{{/each}}
</ul><pre>{{text}}</pre></section>{{/each}}
</body></html>
